{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32654","headline":"罢华原尉上座主尚书 · 刘沧","name":"罢华原尉上座主尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自怜生计事悠悠，浩渺沧浪一钓舟。\n千里梦归清洛近，三年官罢杜陵秋。\n山连绝塞浑无色，水到平沙几处流。\n白露黄花岁时晚，不堪霜鬓镜前愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}